OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of pupils across West
OL,4,Aget GCSE results
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe excruciating wait is over for
OL,7,Fthousands of West Country students who
OL,8,Fhave received their GCSE or equivalent
OL,9,Fresults.
OL,11,FYear 11 pupils filed into school halls
OL,12,Fearlier to open their envelopes.
OL,13,FNationally, the GCSE overall pass rate
OL,14,Fhas fallen slightly - but top grades
OL,15,Fhave edged up across England, Wales and
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,18,F"The prolonged wait really put me on
OL,19,Fedge, I'm ecstatic really [I got]
OL,20,Feverything above sixes," said Tio who
OL,21,Fstudies at Five Acres High School in
OL,22,FColeford, Gloucestershire.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
