OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of pupils across West
OL,4,Aget GCSE results
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Cabot Academy student Chloe from
OL,7,FBristol, who was diagnosed with type 1
OL,8,Fdiabetes just four days before her
OL,9,Ffirst exam, said she was "really proud"
OL,10,Fof the hard work she had put in.
